  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2666342667ed35e49a322785f6f47e64, type: 3}
  m_Name: AzBeta(After)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  paragraphs:
  - speakerName: Az
    text: "You\u2019ll need to make sure both gems are in place."
  - speakerName: Az
    text: I know that one of them requires focusing a beam of light onto a specific
      spot. You should find a dedicated chamber ahead.
  - speakerName: Az
    text: The other requires placing three ingredients into that cauldron.
  - speakerName: Az
    text: The first is a jar containing a green substance, it should be somewhere
      in this room.
  - speakerName: Az
    text: The second is the inactive gem itself, which should be located in the laboratory.
  - speakerName: Az
    text: "Lastly, you\u2019ll need a catalyst: a small glowing crystal, also likely
      to be in the lab."
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: "Got it. I\u2019ll get to work."
